# Frozen player builds kept for bisecting a playback regression. They are
# verbatim copies of commits and are meant to be byte-identical to those blobs --
# `git hash-object` is how that is checked. Without marking them binary, git's
# autocrlf rewrites LF to CRLF on the next checkout, silently invalidating every
# comparison made against them.
tools/legacy/*.html -text -diff

# Everything else keeps the platform default.
* text=auto
